    "Mission Control's swipe and shortcut open Bower's overview instead. Hold fn for Mission Control itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wischgeste und Kurzbefehl von Mission Control öffnen stattdessen Bowers Übersicht. Halte fn gedrückt für Mission Control selbst."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El gesto y el atajo de Mission Control abren la vista general de Bower. Mantén fn para el propio Mission Control."
          }
        },
        "fa": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "کشیدن انگشت و میانبر Mission Control به‌جاش نمای کلی باوِر رو باز می‌کنن. برای خود Mission Control، fn رو نگه دار."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le balayage et le raccourci de Mission Control ouvrent la vue d'ensemble de Bower. Maintenez fn pour Mission Control lui-même."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo scorrimento e la scorciatoia di Mission Control aprono la panoramica di Bower. Tieni premuto fn per Mission Control."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mission Controlのスワイプとショートカットで、代わりにBowerのオーバービューが開きます。Mission Control本体はfnを押しながら。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O gesto e o atalho do Mission Control abrem a visão geral do Bower. Segure fn para o próprio Mission Control."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mission Control 的轻扫和快捷键会改为打开 Bower 的总览。按住 fn 可使用 Mission Control 本身。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
